window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Someone is stealing the Emperor’s roses, and if they take the magical red rose, then love will be lost to everyone forever.</p> <p></p> <p>It’s up to Ned Spinks, Chief Thief Catcher, and his band of motley catchers to apprehend the thief and save the day. But the thief isn’t exactly who they seem to be. Neither is the Emperor.</p> <p></p> <p>Ned and his team will have to go on a quest; defeating vampire mermaids, illusionists, estranged family members and an evil sorcerer in order to win the day. What could possibly go wrong? The Rose Thief is the first quirky magical sword + sorcery mystery adventure set in the Roshaven series of humorous fantasy novels. If you like the wit and humour of Terry Pratchett’s Discworld, then you’ll love The Rose Thief.</p> <p></p> <p>Buy your copy of The Rose Thief today and enjoy this humorous fantasy novel.</p>"; 
